# Title: Renamed CreateDump Utility Execution
# ID: 1a1ed54a-2ba4-4221-94d5-01dee560d71e
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-20
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
# Description: Detects uses of a renamed legitimate createdump.exe LOLOBIN utility to dump process memory
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((process.command_line:* -u * AND process.command_line:* -f * AND process.command_line:*.dmp*)) OR ((process.command_line:* --full * AND process.command_line:* --name * AND process.command_line:*.dmp*))) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"FX_VER_INTERNALNAME_STR")) AND NOT ((process.executable:*\\createdump.exe)))
